{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-data-distribution","title":"为什么需要数据分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/why-data-distribution","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"naive-hashing-problem","title":"朴素哈希的问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/naive-hashing-problem","wordCount":1744,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistent-hashing-basics","title":"一致性哈希基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/consistent-hashing-basics","wordCount":1570,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>在认识一致性哈希这个工具之前，得先把它要拧的那颗螺丝看清楚。这一章铺三块地基，缺一不可。</p>\n<p>第一块是动机。单台机器的内存、磁盘、吞吐都有天花板，当数据量和请求量越过这条线，就必须把数据水平拆分到多台机器，并且有一套确定的规则告诉你「某个键现在该问哪台机器」。这套规则就是数据分布。它不只是为了容量，也为了并行吞吐、为了容错、为了就近访问。</p>\n<p>第二块是反面教材：朴素的取模哈希。<code>hash(key) % n</code> 简单到几乎不需要解释，分布也足够均匀，唯一的问题是那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。一旦集群规模从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 变到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，绝大多数键的取模结果都会改变，意味着几乎整库数据都要换一台机器存放。我们会用具体的数字算清楚这场灾难有多大，这正是一致性哈希存在的理由。</p>\n<p>第三块是一致性哈希的基础概念与四条核心性质——均衡性、单调性、分散性、负载性。这里只在「是什么、为什么要它」的层面建立直觉，把环、虚拟节点这些具体机制留给下一章详细展开。</p>\n<p>三块连起来读，你会自然得到一条逻辑链：要分布数据 → 取模哈希在节点变动时崩盘 → 需要一种让映射「稳定」的哈希。这条链就是后面所有技术的出发点。建议顺序读完本章再进入核心技术。</p>\n"}